WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,320
Twinkle, twinkle, elf

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,320
The sky is full of stars

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,320
Jiaojiao has raised this child so well.

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,720
This is how she looks like a wealthy lady

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,920
The conditions of children in the city are much better than those in the countryside

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:18,520
I heard that Jiaojiao’s piano teacher is a famous pianist.

7
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:22,120
Pistachios, crackle, delicious, close-cropped fruit

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,120
Click click click delicious

9
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,920
Miss Youyou, what kind of talent do you want to perform?

10
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,980
I didn't say I wanted to perform

11
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,420
Yoyo, give your uncle a show

12
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,580
Uncle gives you a red envelope

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:36,100
Yoyo, can you sing a song and dance for your aunt?

14
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,380
Yes, Yoyo, we all want to see you perform

15
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:41,600
Brother, I believe in Youyou

16
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:46,740
Yoyo can't sing

17
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,120
Youyou can dance square dance

18
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,320
Yoyo, you are a girl

19
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,920
Why don't you learn an instrument or something?

20
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,040
He actually went to learn square dancing

21
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:58,920
Look at me, I forgot that Miss Youyou has lived in the village for more than three years.

22
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,520
A rural butcher, probably apart from dancing in the square

23
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,360
There aren't any entertainment activities, right?

24
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:07,000
Yoyo, what songs can you dance to?

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,400
Really good at bragging
